    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Deliveries\"\nsubtitle: \"What the coalition has sent, month by month, checked against the team's data log\"\nexecute:\n  warning: true\n  message: false\n---\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCaring Across Generations sends data as a batch of files, roughly once a\nmonth, and records every file in a log on Box: what it is, when it was\ndelivered, what dates it covers, and whether it has been checked for personal\ninformation. The sync step reads that log, and everything on this page comes\nfrom it. The register lists every file received; the grid below it is the\nteam's own month-by-month view of what has arrived, with an automatic check\nthat it matches the files we actually hold.\n\n## Files received\n\n43 files so far, the most recent delivered\nSeptember 22, 2026. Search by\nany word (a form number, \"open\", \"partial\", a month).\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"reactable html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-ae34ae656c2fe503f675\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-ae34ae656c2fe503f675\">{\"x\":{\"tag\":{\"name\":\"Reactable\",\"attribs\":{\"data\":{\"Delivered\":[\"2026-09-22\",\"2026-09-22\",\"2026-09-22\",\"2026-09-22\",\"2026-09-22\",\"2026-09-17\",\"2026-09-17\",\"2026-09-17\",\"2026-09-17\",\"2026-09-17\",\"2026-09-17\",\"2026-09-17\",\"2026-09-17\",\"2026-09-17\",\"2026-09-04\",\"2026-09-04\",\"2026-09-04\",\"2026-09-04\",\"2026-09-04\",\"2026-09-04\",\"2026-09-04\",\"2026-08-31\",\"2026-08-31\",\"2026-08-31\",\"2026-08-31\",\"2026-08-31\",\"2026-08-31\",\"2026-08-26\",\"2026-08-26\",\"2026-08-26\",\"2026-08-26\",\"2026-08-26\",\"2026-08-08\",\"2026-08-07\",\"2026-08-06\",\"2026-08-05\",\"2026-08-04\",\"2026-07-16\",\"2026-07-13\",\"2026-07-10\",\"2026-07-10\",\"2026-07-07\",\"2026-07-06\"],\"File\":[\"nopii_surv_export_20260801-20260831_f4_complete_closed.xlsx\",\"nopii_surv_export_20260801-20260831_f4_complete_open.xlsx\",\"nop